**Exact fix (round 3):** 2A-LinearRegression.qmd: old "```{r, echo=TRUE, eval=TRUE}
fit = lm(Ozone ~ Temp, data = airquality)
par(mfrow = c(2, 2))" ⇒ "For the residual checks, we continue with the model `Ozone ~ Temp` from the exercise above (the same checks work for any lm).

```{r, echo=TRUE, eval=TRUE}
fit = lm(Ozone ~ Temp, data = airquality)
par(mfrow = c(2, 2))" ;; old "You can see misfit for our model in a)" ⇒ "You can see misfit for the model `Ozone ~ Temp` in a)". (Renaming to fitTemp is optional, it needs the DHARMa chunk changed too.)
